flowchart TB
    accTitle: Public GTA reference library navigation
    accDescr: A reader chooses a GTA task, consults public upstream references and methods, studies evidence, works in their own implementation project and returns reusable findings. No private product owners are cataloged.
    Q["Your GTA question
Behavior / format / protocol / target version"]:::hub
    LIB["GTA Workshop
Public reference library"]:::hub
    CAT["Reference catalog
Six task families / 18 repository references
Original fork parents and recorded evaluations"]:::reference
    GUIDE["Method guides
CLEO / native SDK / builds
Authoring / research / Valkyrie methods"]:::reference
    EVID["Research evidence
Findings / target metadata / generated archives
Exact hashes / provenance / limitations"]:::evidence
    TASK["Choose applicable method
Exact game/profile / supported interfaces
Revision / terms / permitted inputs"]:::gate
    WORK["Your implementation project
Source / toolchain / focused checks
Gameplay and release recorded separately"]:::project
    RETURN["Reusable public findings
Question / method / evidence / actual results
Failures / limitations / original credits"]:::public
    REVIEW["Contribution review
Links / scope / attribution / hashes
Commit and merge the knowledge"]:::gate
    Q --> LIB
    LIB --> CAT & GUIDE & EVID
    CAT & GUIDE & EVID --> TASK
    TASK --> WORK
    WORK --> RETURN
    RETURN --> REVIEW
    REVIEW --> LIB

